{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "5c332245577d84a5aec7d9c32e592a829225129eacb9d4fcdd208d980eb1d8b5", "ja": "歌い踊ろう、サンバリズム・オーケストラ！", "zh": "唱吧跳吧，森巴律动管弦乐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ff67291f3d80f2d5ca97b4338d94c3eb86960c55106d712a59f41133eb4979df", "ja": "公演の打ち上げでピクニックに来た一同。夢\n中になれるものは見付かったか？　と尋ねる\nプロデューサーに、翼は、ひなたのアップル\nパイと返す。仲良くなれたお祝いにと、一同\nはサンバを踊り始めるのだった。", "zh": "一行人去野餐作为公演的庆功宴。\n听见制作人问有没有找到热衷的事物，\n翼回答现在喜欢日向的苹果派。\n为了庆祝两人变得更要好，\n大家一起跳起了森巴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "273712b58151923c1c9a3a250a62bd8982a637a0998638fb7adcab360325031b", "ja": "（今日は打ち上げのピクニック。天気も良く、\nまさにピクニック日和だ！）", "zh": "（今天是庆功宴野餐，\n天气也很好，正是适合野餐的日子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "bfa099f35b6d417ce2a9b01255b9f7b0e0f1d258f61a08a378a21135f41ebe16", "ja": "わっほ～い！　お弁当、い～っぱい作ってきたから、\nたくさん食べてね、みんな♪", "zh": "哇哦──！我做了很多便当，\n大家多吃一点喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "7c1f153277e923c979ffe05b240870ae42f52ac22c32d6c42158517b1ce61219", "ja": "ワオ！　どれも、とってもおいしそうだネ！\nそれじゃあ、そのたまご焼き、いただきます♪", "zh": "哇喔！每一样看起来都好可口呢！\n那这块煎蛋卷我就收下了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "87405eb5adf71513336c4f1753ab1de3a234c17b1822647e1dc2addef86b0b10", "ja": "わーい！　美奈子さんの肉まん～♪　おいしさ\nまんまん～♪　ん～、デリシャスデリシャス～♪", "zh": "耶～！美奈子做的肉包～♪\n好料满满～♪嗯～美味美味～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "f55b39e1402922f03a26ba21b7318c245c2dd9dd6f581ef63db968df02c075cb", "ja": "あたしもね、アップルパイを焼いてみたんだぁ。\nよかったら、これもみんなで食べてねぇ。", "zh": "我也试着烤了苹果派来喔，\n也请大家品尝看看呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7bd736b28b8d12e2bd02e2156dab49c7603c86aca515d72541d8abf254484250", "ja": "すごーい！　じゃあさっそく、\nひなたちゃんのアップルパイ、いただきまーす♪", "zh": "好厉害！那我马上来尝尝看吧。\n日向做的苹果派，我开动啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "13d5d75fffe41372ca80bacdf3beaf7fc800be90b08778dc857b5f42bea2183d", "ja": "……わっ！　おいしいね、これ！", "zh": "……哇！这个很好吃耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "5d5427d508e7d441ba26de14e62e2875b6b184c14e8c571e79b2ea79da358459", "ja": "ああっ、ずるいずるい私も～！　はむっ……。", "zh": "啊啊，好贼好贼我也要～！（咬一口……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "5ea185d0ed93944a18b06e7b8bca4f9faea84b12075a970ce000a8d8cf8405a2", "ja": "はう！　本当だ！　サクサクとろ～りで、\nお店のアップルパイみたい♪", "zh": "啊呜！真的耶！酥脆又绵密，\n就像店里卖的苹果派一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "4f0c004583fe5dd44d415018f394a47d6ca5f4e73f7206f25c5d37796e07862b", "ja": "えへへ。喜んでもらえてうれしいよぉ。これ、\nばあちゃんが送ってくれたリンゴで作ったんだぁ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，你们喜欢我就开心了。\n这个呀，是我用奶奶送来的苹果做的哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "2d5b90d8a849300d360a24d39089b76b4c8e28ed6a920045294c90de587fad32", "ja": "翼さん、この前は踊りを教えてくれてありがとねぇ。\nおかげで、楽しくダンスできたべさ。", "zh": "翼，谢谢你之前教我跳舞呢～\n多亏你，我才能开心学会跳舞哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "51c12c96153eab0bb6b44c81b6daa0836e84249cb296b91a4c699c88260da5ff", "ja": "お礼なんていいよ～。\nあ、アップルパイは食べちゃったけど♪", "zh": "用不着道谢啦～\n啊，不过苹果派我已经吃掉了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "70cd1d26a5283b80ea60abad9407d61358684f14db947dfb8d74f995abf15907", "ja": "いいんだよぉ。まだまだあるから、\n好きなだけ食べてねぇ、翼さん。", "zh": "没关系的，还有很多，\n尽管吃呢～翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "097c22a784de1022036c8ba768f71172ffbfa783568a74c9040979ac05fa0308", "ja": "……。\nねえねえ、ひなたちゃん。", "zh": "……\n欸欸，日向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "a49d397aa02784f23123b34c219531ab1a9e3a198135baa0c7f898fba1fbda43", "ja": "なんだい、翼さん？", "zh": "怎么啦，翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9dc56da8bf179be5f7c22144df76d0705f891635bdd73c913b519857aef511ca", "ja": "前から思ってたんだけど～。同い年なんだから\n「さん」なんてつけなくていいよ？", "zh": "我之前就在想了～\n我们同年纪，可以叫得亲昵一点嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "21b3a9d1d538e53298f7038f2efd6af7e5660f9ff8f995fb13a89cc3b5038d54", "ja": "「翼」とか、「翼ちゃん」とかの方が、\nわたし、うれしいな？", "zh": "要是能叫我「小翼」之类的，\n我会很开心的说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "bed49e1bf07abf8f2e182be4cfc559b5d957b956a30e78d17b441066938faa54", "ja": "そ……そうかい？\nでも、なんだかちょっこし、照れてしまって……。", "zh": "是……是这样吗？\n可是，喊起来有点害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "84395792d86e06569521bf6b0f01c4cfa8e01c64a012656629b5ab09ea250243", "ja": "照れなくていいよ、ひなたちゃん！\nだって、ひなたちゃんと翼ちゃん、友達でしょ！", "zh": "不需要害羞啊，小日！\n因为小日和小翼是朋友嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "8f3a582910ae5124ac37612a058d0ae77b180e5042cb15d4a9c8ddc339c2fd9a", "ja": "う、うん。じゃあ……。", "zh": "唔，嗯。那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "e1edbda706e8d782690ee31bdb69c09eeecd7ec20c93a9214040ba1aa19f4ed9", "ja": "翼ちゃん？", "zh": "小翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f42de6bdda46fcf6633b219e8cc7c49182acc34a19dc346ab52895761fe1fa3b", "ja": "うんっ♪\nありがと、ひなたちゃん！", "zh": "嗯♪\n谢谢你，日向！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3814eef24266584283ea437381533676d64d4a008da68cef4e19db2d0a8a7f57", "ja": "（太陽のような笑顔が広がっていく……。この公演は\n成功するべくして成功した気がするな……！）", "zh": "（太阳般的笑容扩散开来……\n感觉这场公演应该成功，然后也真的成功了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "93580f12298c33339f96f87977ec304b48b357768b3081a921c034eadde8b217", "ja": "そうだ！　同い年ついでに、\n今度3人でどこかに遊びに行かない？", "zh": "对了！既然同年龄，\n下次我们三个人一起去哪里玩吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6ddf5187b41a945c366a4f30c2a68f17e383a52f3715c9910af3bec21f0ecee0", "ja": "そうだね～。じゃあ、トッテモタカイタウンに\n服でも見に行こうよ♪　ツリーもあるし～。", "zh": "也是呢～那么，我们一起去高耸入云城看衣服吧♪\n再顺便爬高耸入云塔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "d4610ac352fbe0fb8ca13ea13f6247bc3449cfbc7909effc8a633cbf88050365", "ja": "ええ～っ！？\nし、下の階のお店だけなら行くけど……。", "zh": "咦咦～！？\n如、如果只去楼下的店舖，我是可以去啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "10101050b748c7f69e30b53fad4a10458bfe5d89eaf01de4372ac251d5943f4d", "ja": "えーっ？　せっかく行くんだし、\nまた登ろうよ～。ダメぇ？", "zh": "咦？难得去一趟，\n再爬上去一次嘛～不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "681efd74a9e347a4cf9b1b6ec0403b1d438f245c9a5b6897bd93f34c37a591c6", "ja": "うう～っ、{$P$}さぁん～……。", "zh": "呜呜～{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "eb651f943b6dabb4720363efec7a2618641efe896b736052171c49ad168aa343", "ja": "はは、あんまり可奈をいじめるなよ、翼。\nそれから、ちょっと聞きたいんだけど……。", "zh": "哈哈，别太捉弄可奈啊，翼。\n另外我有件事想问一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_1029", "source_sha256": "28d48a40b36fe6ef48728ba5c3b16a5338fa1a687b58e7a3057689e2cd7c81ab", "ja": "夢中になれそう？", "zh": "你有找到热衷的事物吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_2000_p", "source_sha256": "7b34dac7eba1d1c884e7f98514e8d0eb9e4a13477f3653deaf508d8ced642431", "ja": "翼もアイドルを頑張って、公演は大成功だったよな。\nそれで何か、夢中になれそうなものは見つかったか？", "zh": "翼努力当偶像，公演也圆满成功了。\n所以你有找到什么热衷的事物吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_2001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7240f80ca1c88050b3de057912bf4cc8b1de7230dc1b30c447e4177a93b41b3a", "ja": "えっ？　ああ、うーんと……。", "zh": "咦？啊啊，唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_2002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5998c21a30a3c26a95fbb0d2cfc88a21ba33e934ee8200e4089931e6b72f6b74", "ja": "今は、ひなたちゃんのアップルパイに夢中でーす♪\n超おいしいんですよ～、これ！", "zh": "现在热衷的是日向的苹果派喔──♪\n这个超好吃的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_2003_035hin", "source_sha256": "b1b312804f1058f09f7e6c9661a126b363f7ddd3a197bfa3e2961b6e03d8db80", "ja": "ありゃ～……。\nえへへ、ありがとねぇ、翼ちゃん♪", "zh": "啊呀……\n嘿嘿，谢谢你呢～小翼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_2004_036kan", "source_sha256": "f219eb72b0821102a40b0a7251293640ea6406ad832a738a6bcfe3b73296c1a3", "ja": "ああっ、なんかやっぱりずるい！\n私も、私も夢中～！", "zh": "啊，果然还是好贼！\n我也是，我也很着迷喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_2005_035hin", "source_sha256": "24fd8bae92396b0b82d2d9513bd173fbca73409086b15d6582ca1941cacb8cb2", "ja": "ありゃりゃ～。\n可奈ちゃんまで、そんな……恥ずかしいよぉ～。", "zh": "啊呀呀～\n竟然连可奈都这么说……真令人害羞哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_07_2006_019min", "source_sha256": "16bac00a71ecfb7a76bd00f49303cdf8cf3ae99f27c3b34322ac30f7fe48c0ff", "ja": "翼ちゃんたち、\nとっても仲良くなったみたいだね♪", "zh": "看来小翼你们几个，\n已经变得非常要好了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
